{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a87c386f-8f29-8109-8ac3-9c7f8828a654",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T11:18:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Amara Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:16:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:16:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I'm calling for my mom. Her trash and recycling didn't get picked up again. It's the second miss in a row."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:16:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry about that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:16:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "347 Mill Street. Up on the Historic Hill side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:16:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "347 Mill. Got it. And the last two pickups were both skipped, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Last week and then this week. The bins were out at the curb both times. Is it because of the nor'easter last weekend, Saturday into Sunday? Or is that a separate thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be some of it. The storm pushed routes behind, and some streets got skipped. I'm noting it down as a missed pickup, two weeks running, 347 Mill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So how do I know it'll actually get picked up this time? Like, does a note in the system do anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes to the crew supervisor, who sends a truck back through to catch missed streets. Leave the bins out where they are."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Leave them out. Got it. Can I also ask what's allowed in recycling now? Pizza boxes, glass, and those plastic clamshell containers. I run a food truck, it's parked for the season, but I'm cleaning it out and have a lot of that stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Clean, empty glass bottles and jars are fine. Clamshells are usually okay if they're rinsed and have a recycling number on them. Pizza boxes, if they're greasy, they go in the trash. Clean cardboard top is okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So greasy pizza box, trash. Clean glass, recycling. Clamshells, rinsed. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. Do you need a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:54-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0157. We'll get a truck out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:17:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
